      <div class="article-content">
        <div class="cta-box">
          <p>Struggling to decide between Calm and Headspace? BetterHelp can match you with a therapist who takes a personalised approach — no generic advice, just evidence-based support that works for your situation.</p>
          <a href="https://partners.betterhelp.com/go/referral/carevues" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Find the Right Therapist for You →</a>
        </div>

        <p>Two names dominate the meditation app space: Calm and Headspace. If you've looked into meditation at all in Australia, you've almost certainly encountered both. They're the reason the meditation app category went from niche to normalised — and they've done it by taking very different approaches.</p>

        <p>We spent time with both. Here's the honest comparison — what each does well, where each falls short, and which one is likely better for you depending on what you're looking for.</p>

        <h2>Calm vs Headspace at a Glance</h2>

